The Dry is a 2020 Australian mystery drama thriller film directed by Robert Connolly, from a screenplay by
Connolly and Harry Cripps, and is based on the 2016 book of the same name by Jane Harper.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film stars Eric Bana, Genevieve O'Reilly, Keir O'Donnell and John Polson.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
The film had its premiere in Melbourne on 11 December 2020, before Roadshow Films released the
film in Australia on 1 January 2021, and received positive reviews from critics.

14
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
IFC Films released the film in the United States on 21 May 2021.

15
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
